            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>ព្រះរាជាណាចក្រកម្ពុជា
ជាតិ សាសនា ព្រះមហាក្សត្រ</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Center</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox39</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>0cm</Top>
            <Left>13.44787cm</Left>
            <Height>1.31851cm</Height>
            <Width>5.74556cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>1</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox40">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>ក្រសួងអប់រំ យុវជន និង​​​ កីឡា
សាកលវិទ្យល័យបៀលប្រាយ</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Center</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Parameters!branch.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Center</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox39</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>1.47285cm</Top>
            <Left>0.29774cm</Left>
            <Height>1.95791cm</Height>
            <Width>6.0807cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>2</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox41">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>បញ្ជីរាយនាមនិស្សិតដែលបានប្រឡងជ្រើសរើសជាប់ជាស្ថាពរឪ្យចូលរៀនថ្នាក់ឆ្នាំសិក្សាមូលដ្ឋាន
</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Parameters!title.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>
នៃមហាវិទ្យាល័យ</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Parameters!school.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> នៅសាកលវិទ្យាល័យបៀលប្រាយ </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Khmer OS Muol Light</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Parameters!branch.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
